DESCRIPTION:Green Library's latest book display features books on "Witches 
 and Witchcraft." From scholarly works on the history of witchcraft and wit
 ch trials to novels featuring witches\, these titles will spark your curio
 sity and might even leave you spellbound. All books are available to check
  out.
