UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53818815587426
DTSTART:20261115T220000Z
DTEND:20261115T230000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us for casual in-gallery conversations in our special exhi
 bition\, JANE!\, facilitated by our Museum Engagement Guides. Enjoy a spot
 light tour focusining on a single object\, followed by an open conversatio
 n. \n\nCurated by Associate Curator of European Art\, Patrick R. Crowley\,
  JANE! celebrates the aesthetic and affective excesses of Jane Stanford\, 
 the Gilded Age founder and matriarch of Stanford University. Bringing toge
 ther precious keepsakes\, souvenirs\, archaeological detritus\, and spooky
  messages from beyond the grave\, the exhibition reveals the campy undersi
 de of a familiar biography and perhaps an even more familiar murder myster
 y.\n\nFrom her elegant French gowns to a colossal painting of her jewels\,
  from the Egyptian artifacts she acquired for her fledgling museum to a co
 ntainer of her beauty cream excavated from her Palo Alto mansion destroyed
  in the 1906 San Francisco earthquake\, JANE! presents various idiosyncrat
 ic artifacts of Stanford lore—many of them shown for the very first time
 —and very probably for the last.\n\nWe gratefully acknowledge lead suppo
 rt for JANE! provided by Pamela and David Hornik. Sustained support genero
 usly provided by The C. Diane Christensen Fund for African Art.\n\n---\n\n
 Public tours are free for all. Please check in at the visitor services des
 k* in the main museum lobby.\n\n*If you plan to bring a large group with y
 ou (10 people or more)\, please notify us one week in advance via this for
 m so we can inform our Guides. Thank you!\n\nIMAGE: Astley D. M. Cooper (A
 merican\, 1856–19240.) "Mrs. Stanford’s Jewel Collection\," 1898. 50 x
  75 in. Oil on canvas. Stanford Family Collections\, Cantor Arts Center\, 
 Stanford University\, JLS.16294
GEO:37.432981;-122.170494
LOCATION:Cantor Arts Center\, Stanford Family Room (122)
SUMMARY:Gallery Conversations | JANE!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.stanford.edu/event/copy-of-gallery-conversatio
 ns-jeremy-frey-woven-8444
CATEGORIES:Tour
END:VEVENT
