DESCRIPTION:Interested in advancing your studies in Earth Systems? Join us 
 on for a hybrid information session to explore Earth Systems’ Coterminal
  Master’s Degrees\, learn about the application process\, hear from curr
 ent students\, and get your questions answered!\n\nMS in Earth Systems\n\n
 Explore complex environmental challenges at the intersection of human acti
 vities and natural Earth system changes. Tailor your studies to your inter
 ests while developing the knowledge and skills to address critical social 
 and environmental issues and sustainability challenges.\n\n \n\n MA in Env
 ironmental Communication\n\nLearn to communicate complex environmental cha
 llenges through advanced theoretical frameworks\, analytical tools\, and p
 ractical skills. Build your expertise through specialized coursework\, ind
 ependent project work\, and a professional practicum.\n\nFor more informat
 ion\, visit the Earth Systems Coterminal Programs page.\n\nEvent Details\n
 \nDate: Tuesday\, November 17\n\nTime: 4:00–5:00pm\n\nLocation: Y2E2 382
 \, and Zoom\n\nRSVP: https://luma.com/hzrk95cd\n\nZoom: https://stanford.z
 oom.us/j/95136885017?pwd=nN6SRRuDQblG8EGscLeyqqbbJ7RpbD.1#success\n\nLight
  refreshments will be provided for in-person attendees. \n\nWe look forwar
 d to seeing you there!
GEO:37.42816;-122.175935
LOCATION:Y2E2 Building\, 382
SUMMARY:Earth Systems Program Coterm Info Session
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.stanford.edu/event/earth-systems-program-coter
 m-info-session
CATEGORIES:Lecture/Presentation/Talk
END:VEVENT
